<?xml version="1.0"?>
<alert xmlns="urn:oasis:names:tc:emergency:cap:1.2"><identifier>550ec3d6-d549-463e-a7d2-133da7dad7c6</identifier><sender>PAGASA-DOST</sender><sent>2026-10-24T05:19:37+08:00</sent><status>Actual</status><msgType>Update</msgType><scope>Public</scope><references>PAGASA-DOST,a53f2598-479a-40b1-b1a3-89561dc43dd4,2026-10-23T17:40:00+08:00</references><info><category>Met</category><event>General Flood Advisory (Severe)</event><responseType>Prepare</responseType><urgency>Expected</urgency><severity>Severe</severity><certainty>Likely</certainty><expires>2026-10-24T17:19:37+08:00</expires><senderName>PAGASA-DOST</senderName><headline>General Flood Advisory</headline><description>Under present weather conditions, At 3:00 AM today, the center of the eye of Typhoon "ROSAL" {CHAMPI} was estimated based on all available data at 415 km North of Itbayat, Batanes (24.5&#xB0;N, 122.5&#xB0;E) with maximum sustained winds of 150 km/h near the center and gustiness of up to 185 km/h. It is moving Southwestward at 10 km/h. Intertropical Convergence Zone (ITCZ) affecting Palawan, Visayas and Mindanao.  
The 12-hour rainfall forecast is light to moderate rains and thunderstorms.  
WATERCOURSES STILL LIKELY TO BE AFFECTED :  

 + **Batanes** - All rivers and its tributaries  
</description><instruction>People living near the mountain slopes and in the low lying areas of the above mentioned river systems and the **Local Disaster Risk Reduction and Management Councils** concerned advised to be alert for possible flashfloods and landslides.</instruction><web>http://www.pagasa.dost.gov.ph/index.php/26-hydromet/1582-flood-forecast-terms-and-symbols</web><contact>PAGASA-DOST</contact><parameter><valueName>layer:Google:Region:0.1</valueName><value>Region 2 (Cagayan Valley)</value></parameter><area><areaDesc>Batanes</areaDesc><polygon>20.482878224317,122.02360572053 20.452643576969,122.02629775526 20.408589155683,121.96347148931 20.366095173456,121.97386873411 20.348038630495,121.91849970251 20.404843493649,121.92863582449 20.488478973437,122.00314244964 20.482878224317,122.02360572053</polygon><geocode><valueName>SAME</valueName><value>020900000</value></geocode></area></info><Signature xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/09/xmldsig#"><SignedInfo><CanonicalizationMethod Algorithm="http://www.w3.org/TR/2001/REC-xml-c14n-20010315"/><SignatureMethod Algorithm="http://www.w3.org/2000/09/xmldsig#rsa-sha1"/><Reference URI=""><Transforms><Transform Algorithm="http://www.w3.org/2000/09/xmldsig#enveloped-signature"/></Transforms><DigestMethod Algorithm="http://www.w3.org/2000/09/xmldsig#sha1"/><DigestValue>6HVa1prGGvH+yp0usxfB2rI2PuA=</DigestValue></Reference></SignedInfo><SignatureValue>inOss2/KYqErriMQnBf57+9204opM4Zqgs5/HdwvkmWtwT0GKVC61389f43G9sVO
